        "Description": "Welcome back to Dubai 47! For this mission, we will be sending to Miami, Florida, where&apos;s going to be a Grand Place took place in the next Weekend. With our requests you&apos;ll be tasked to eliminate Lalit Mandal, who owns First Class Emirates ticket from Dubai to Miami and Roy Albert, who owns a ticket to a Grand Prix race in Miami. Once when you&apos;re done, we will book to Emirates EK213 flight from Dubai to Miami with Boeing 777-300ER on First Class. Good Luck!",
